  "name": "PG - Inquiry Intake",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PG - Inquiry Intake (Draft, import-untested)\nSynthetic data only. No AI, no sends.\n\n1. Webhook node: pick credential **PG Webhook Secret**.\n2. Pick the data table in the 3 Data table nodes (pg_leads, pg_leads, pg_action_log).\n3. Workflow Settings > Error workflow = **PG - Error Logger**.\n4. Activate, then run **PG - Test Sender**.\n\nThe 'pg-force-error' check in Validate is a test hook. Remove before client delivery.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -80
      ],
      "id": "e3f8facb-7fb1-bdb7-0d07-db244e65ebd4",
      "name": "Note: setup"
    },
